36a0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Betz</surname><given-names>SF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Disulfide bonds and the stability of globular proteins</article-title><source>Protein Science</source><year>1993</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>1551</fpage><lpage>1558</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8251931</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bradford</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A rapid and sensitive method for the quantitation of microgram quantities of protein utilizing the principle of protein-dye binding</article-title><source>Analytical Biochemistry</source><year>1976</year><volume>72</volume><fpage>248</fpage><lpage>254</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">942051</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0003-2697(76)90527-3</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ashcroft</surname><given-names>AELH</given-names></name><name><surname>Macedo</surname><given-names>JMB</given-names></name><name><surname>Horn</surname><given-names>WT</given-names></name><name><surname>Stonehouse</surname><given-names>NJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Stockley</surname><given-names>PG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Engineering thermal stability in RNA phage capsids via disulphide bonds</article-title><source>Nanoscience and Nanotechnology</source><year>2005</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>2034</fpage><lpage>2041</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16430137</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1166/jnn.2005.507</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lim</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Downey</surname><given-names>T